  "published": "2026-10-28T20:58:47.65Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.10: 50.3-89.1% fewer warm allocated bytes across 20 measured 8-bit/16-bit encode/decode cases, including 12 MP. Scoped pooled buffers, direct section writes to output streams, integer-channel lossless output, specialized 16-bit loops, active-range tree histograms and direct sRGB transfer. Encoded bytes, decoded pixels, metadata edits and JPEG reconstruction remain identical to 0.7.9. No API changes. Peak RSS is measured separately; see docs/releases/release-0.7.10.md and docs/benchmarks/speed.md.",
